I kept the same logic but added `__builtin_expect` hints so the common decode path (unresolved `type`, valid profile/index) falls through without taken branches.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetType() const
{
    if (__builtin_expect(type != FIT_UINT8_INVALID, 0))
        return type;

    if (__builtin_expect((profile == NULL) || (profileIndex >= profile->numFields), 0))
        return FIT_UINT8_INVALID;

    return profile->fields[profileIndex].type;
}
```